WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
It doesn't matter if you are stronger than me, after all

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,520
I also rely on the elders of the sect.

3
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:07,700
I have just come this far, my master.

4
00:00:08,540 --> 00:00:10,540
He died just to pass on his true energy to me.

5
00:00:11,450 --> 00:00:13,290
I have the names of the Ten and Five Saints

6
00:00:13,870 --> 00:00:15,110
He painted it with his life

7
00:00:15,820 --> 00:00:16,740
I don't care anymore

8
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:18,540
We can't let anyone smear this name.

9
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:21,480
So Gu Shiyi must die

10
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:23,560
But he seems to have

11
00:00:24,080 --> 00:00:25,240
Inheritance of Qi

12
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:30,660
Third revision of notes

13
00:00:30,740 --> 00:00:32,140
Where does the inheritance of zhenqi come from?

14
00:00:32,340 --> 00:00:33,860
If it is inherited from the Five Saints

15
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,540
That should be heard, I guess.

16
00:00:37,940 --> 00:00:39,180
It should be the second day

17
00:00:39,850 --> 00:00:40,970
Second single day

18
00:00:41,290 --> 00:00:42,250
It's not surprising

19
00:00:42,410 --> 00:00:45,990
It’s not surprising, Brother Haoran

20
00:00:46,970 --> 00:00:48,370
Since I decided to kill him

21
00:00:48,810 --> 00:00:51,890
Then you have to prepare for the worst.

22
00:00:52,210 --> 00:00:53,730
If there is a true energy inheritance

23
00:00:54,170 --> 00:00:56,380
It’s not enough for me and the guy named Meng alone

24
00:00:56,540 --> 00:00:57,660
And Wen Ziliang

25
00:00:57,940 --> 00:00:59,460
Gu Shiyi snatched his medicine

26
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:02,800
Steal that sick monster's medicine

27
00:01:04,350 --> 00:01:06,910
No wonder he is anxious about that boy

28
00:01:07,070 --> 00:01:11,680
The heart is smaller than the true traitor. What about you? You don’t take action.
